# Old site URLs -> new pages. Keeps the rankings the current site has earned.
#
# The existing site at calitintsca.com could not be crawled from the build
# environment, so its page list is unknown and old_url_map in
# src/data/site.json is empty. BEFORE LAUNCH: export the indexed URLs from
# Search Console (Indexing -> Pages) or crawl the live site, add each old path
# here with its new target, and mirror them in old_url_map. A 301 passes
# ranking on; a 404 throws it away.
#
# Format:  /old-path    /new-path/    301!
# Example: /services    /services/    301!

